+    An entry may also be {"addr": "0x...", "expect": ["0x3863000F", ...]}: the
+    words the function must start with (newlib's are the default, see
+    SJLJ_SIGNATURES). -> {"setjmp": {addr: words}, "longjmp": {addr: words}}."""
